PROCEDURE Mult( x, y : COMPLEX ) : COMPLEX;
Complex number multiplication routine for fractal generation calculations. Works with COMPLEX data structure containing real and imaginary components.

PROCEDURE Mult( x, y : COMPLEX ) : COMPLEX;

VAR
    Result : COMPLEX;
BEGIN
    Result.R := x.R*y.R - x.I*y.I;
    Result.I := x.R*y.I + x.I*y.R;
    RETURN( Result );
END Mult;

