RADARPAS / E300Interface / TimeRead (Modula-2 procedure)
PROCEDURE TimeRead(VAR ForChar : CHAR; Milli : CARDINAL);
Delays Milli milliseconds. 0<Milli<60000!!!
Calls: 2 in rs (Return Number of recived bytes in buffer: Receive, RxCount), 1 in Map (CheckMap), 1 in RadioRx (Receive), 1 in RADIOTX (SendPic) and 1 in Serial (TimeRead)
Called by: 1 in Control (ReadParam) and 1 in this module (ReadParam)

PROCEDURE TimeRead(VAR ForChar : CHAR; Milli : CARDINAL);
(* Milli must be between 0 and 60000!!! *)
VAR
  OK         : BOOLEAN;
  StartTime,
  CurrTime   : Time;
  Key        : CHAR;
BEGIN
  GetTime(StartTime);
  LOOP
    IF RxCount() > 0 THEN
      Receive(ForChar,1);
      EXIT;
    END (* IF *);
    GetTime(CurrTime);
    IF CurrTime.millisec>=StartTime.millisec THEN
      IF CurrTime.millisec-StartTime.millisec>=Milli THEN EXIT END;
    ELSIF 60000-StartTime.millisec+CurrTime.millisec>=Milli THEN
      ForChar := 000C;
(*D   IO.WrStr( 'TIME-OUT' ); *)
      EXIT;
    END (* IF *);
  END (* LOOP *);
END TimeRead;

