RADARPAS / FracGen / Mult (Modula-2 procedure)
PROCEDURE Mult( x, y : COMPLEX ) : COMPLEX;
Multiplies two complex numbers representing radar signal amplitudes and phases for display processing. Works with COMPLEX data structures containing real and imaginary components.

PROCEDURE Mult( x, y : COMPLEX ) : COMPLEX;

VAR
    Result : COMPLEX;
BEGIN
    Result.R := x.R*y.R - x.I*y.I;
    Result.I := x.R*y.I + x.I*y.R;
    RETURN( Result );
END Mult;

