PROCEDURE GenPrefixData( VAR ForPicture : ARRAY OF BYTE;
Generates prefix data for radar picture transmission, fills array with header information before image data is sent to serial port. Works with picture buffer and prefix table structure.
Called by: 2 in this module (SetPrefix, TransmitPic)

PROCEDURE GenPrefixData( VAR ForPicture : ARRAY OF BYTE;
                                PicSize : CARDINAL;
                          VAR PrefixTab : PrefixTabPtr );

VAR
