RADARPAS / SCREEN / EGAOut (Modula-2 procedure)
PROCEDURE EGAOut(C : CHAR);
Outputs character to EGA screen buffer at current cursor position, handling backspace, line feed, and carriage return control characters. Updates cursor position and wraps to next line when end of row reached.

PROCEDURE EGAOut(C : CHAR);
VAR
  CharPos,I : CARDINAL;
BEGIN
  CASE C OF
    ASCII.bs : IF CursX>0 THEN CursX:=CursX-1; END|
    ASCII.lf : IF CursY<YMax THEN CursY:=CursY+1; END|
    ASCII.cr : CursX:=0
  ELSE
    CharPos:=(CursX+XPos)+(CursY+YPos)*1180;
    FOR I:=0 TO 13 DO
      ScreenMem[CharPos+I*80]:=CharTab14^[ORD(C)*14+I];
    END;
    IF CursX<XMax THEN 
      CursX:=CursX+1;
    ELSE
      CursX:=0;
      CursY:=CursY+1;
    END;
  END;
END EGAOut;

