SSM / FITR / SetReading (Turbo Pascal procedure)
PROCEDURE SetReading(PumpNumber : INTEGER;Value : REAL);
Updates pump readings in transaction data structure, calculates sales, validates increasing values, and displays error messages for decreasing readings. Works with internal TR data structure and screen output.
